{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Cannon Barrage|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Gangplank
|skill        = R
|icon         = Cannon Barrage.png
|blurbicon         = Cannon Barrage.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Gangplank}} orders a cannon bombardment to the target location, each blast deals {{as|magic damage}} and {{tip|slow|slows}} enemies within.
|blurb2       = '''Gangplank''' can improve ''Cannon Barrage'' by purchasing upgrades in the shop with {{ai|Silver Serpents|Gangplank}}.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Gangplank''' shoots a flare into the air, signaling his ship off-shore to fire upon the target location, calling down 12 waves of cannonballs in clusters of 3 every 2 seconds, each wave in a cluster hitting {{fd|0.25}} seconds after the other, and granting {{tip|sight}} of the area for the duration. Each wave deals {{as|magic damage}} to all enemies within the area and {{tip|slow|slows}} them by 30% for {{fd|0.5}} seconds.
|leveling    = {{st|Magic Damage Per Wave|{{ap|40 to 100}} {{as|(+ 10% AP)}}|Magic Damage Per Cluster|{{ap|40*3 to 100*3}} {{as|(+ {{ap|10*3}}% AP)}}}}
{{st|Total Magic Damage|{{ap|40*12 to 100*12}} {{as|(+ {{ap|10*12}}% AP)}}}}
|description2 = While within the [[shop]] area, '''Gangplank''' can purchase upgrades for his ship at the cost of 500 ''{{ai|Silver Serpents|Gangplank}}'' each, which improve ''Cannon Barrage'' with new effects:
|icon3        = Death's Daughter item.png
|description3 = {{sbc|{{ii|Death's Daughter}}:}} A large cannonball lands in the center of the barrage after the first cluster of waves occur, dealing a cluster's worth of {{as|true damage}} to enemies within the impact and {{tip|slow|slowing}} them by 75% for 1 second.
|leveling3    = {{st|True Damage with {{ii|Death's Daughter}}|{{ap|40*3 to 100*3}} {{as|(+ {{ap|10*3}}% AP)}}}}
{{st|Total Mixed Damage with {{ii|Death's Daughter}}|{{ap|40*12+40*3 to 100*12+100*3}} {{as|(+ {{ap|10*12+10*3}}% AP)}}}}
|icon4        = Fire at Will item.png
|description4 = {{sbc|{{ii|Fire at Will}}:}} ''Cannon Barrage'' fires{{ft|6 additional waves|2 additional clusters}}over its duration; 18 waves of cannonballs are called down in clusters of 3 every {{fd|1.3{{recurring|3}}}} seconds.
|leveling4    = {{st|Total Magic Damage with {{ii|Fire at Will}}|{{ap|40*18 to 100*18}} {{as|(+ {{ap|10*18}}% AP)}}}}
{{st|Maximum Mixed Total Damage with {{ii|Fire at Will}} and {{ii|Death's Daughter}}|{{ap|40*18+40*3 to 100*18+100*3}} {{as|(+ {{ap|10*18+10*3}}% AP)}}}}
|icon5        = Raise Morale item.png
|description5 = {{sbc|{{ii|Raise Morale}}:}} ''Cannon Barrage'' grants '''Gangplank''' and all allies within the area {{sti|{{as|40% '''bonus''' movement speed}}}}, lingering for 2 seconds.
|target range = Global
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|effect radius= {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|580|Volley damage and Raise Morale effect radius}}
|inner radius = {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|170|Death's Daughter}}
|cooldown     = {{ap|160 to 120}}
|cdstart      = Starts on-cast
|cost         = 100
|costtype     = Mana
|targeting    = Location
|affects      = Enemies
|damagetype   = Magic
|spellshield  = True
|spelleffects = AOE
|notes        = 
* '''Gangplank's''' upgrades for ''Cannon Barrage'' are offered through a special menu in the HUD which is only visible while inside the area eligible for accessing the shop. Within the special menu, the player can purchase an upgrade by {{LMB}} clicking on its portrait or via the Champion Specific Interaction [[hotkey]]s (default: {{sbc|Shift}}+{{sbc|F1–F3}}).
** Purchased upgrades have a trim around their portrait. Upgrades that he does not have enough currency to purchase are greyed out.
* ''Cannon Barrage's'' slow lingers for {{fd|0.25}} seconds after affected enemies leave the target area.
* If an Attack order is issued and is being cycled through casting ''Cannon Barrage'', and no other order is issued after casting it, '''Gangplank's''' next basic attack is delayed by 1 second.
[[File:Gangplank Cannon Barrage shop menu HUD.png|thumb|200px|left|Upgrade menu HUD. Located above the inventory.]]
|flavorsound  = {{sm2|Gangplank_Original_R_2.ogg}} ''"Volley fire!"''
}}

