{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Mega Gnar|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Gnar
|skill        = I
|icon         = Rage Gene 3.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Innate:}} {{ci|Mega Gnar|Gnar}} gains increased '''base''' {{sti|hp|{{as|health}}}}, {{sti|ad|{{as|attack damage}}}}, {{sti|ar|{{as|armor}}}}, and {{sti|mr|{{as|magic resist}}}}.
|description  = {{sbc|Innate:}} '''Gnar''' gains the following increases to his '''base''' statistics: {{as|{{pplevel|({{ccd|Mega Gnar|hp_base}}-{{ccd|Gnar|hp_base}})+({{ccd|Mega Gnar|hp_lvl}}-{{ccd|Gnar|hp_lvl}})*(x-1)*(0.7025+0.0175*(x-1))|formula={{#expr:{{ccd|Mega Gnar|hp_base}}-{{ccd|Gnar|hp_base}}}} base + {{#expr:{{ccd|Mega Gnar|hp_lvl}}-{{ccd|Gnar|hp_lvl}}}} growth}}|health}} {{as|'''base''' health}}, {{as|{{pplevel|({{ccd|Mega Gnar|dam_base}}-{{ccd|Gnar|dam_base}})+({{ccd|Mega Gnar|dam_lvl}}-{{ccd|Gnar|dam_lvl}})*(x-1)*(0.7025+0.0175*(x-1))|formula={{#expr:{{ccd|Mega Gnar|dam_base}}-{{ccd|Gnar|dam_base}}}} base + {{#expr:{{ccd|Mega Gnar|dam_lvl}}-{{ccd|Gnar|dam_lvl}}}} growth}}|attack damage}} {{as|'''base''' attack damage}}, {{as|{{pplevel|({{ccd|Mega Gnar|arm_base}}-{{ccd|Gnar|arm_base}})+({{ccd|Mega Gnar|arm_lvl}}-{{ccd|Gnar|arm_lvl}})*(x-1)*(0.7025+0.0175*(x-1))|formula={{#expr:{{ccd|Mega Gnar|arm_base}}-{{ccd|Gnar|arm_base}}}} base + {{#expr:{{ccd|Mega Gnar|arm_lvl}}-{{ccd|Gnar|arm_lvl}}}} growth}}|armor}} {{as|'''base''' armor}}, and {{as|{{pplevel|({{ccd|Mega Gnar|mr_base}}-{{ccd|Gnar|mr_base}})+({{ccd|Mega Gnar|mr_lvl}}-{{ccd|Gnar|mr_lvl}})*(x-1)*(0.7025+0.0175*(x-1))|formula={{#expr:{{ccd|Mega Gnar|mr_base}}-{{ccd|Gnar|mr_base}}}} base + {{#expr:{{ccd|Mega Gnar|mr_lvl}}-{{ccd|Gnar|mr_lvl}}}} growth}}|magic resistance}} {{as|'''base''' magic resistance}}. However, he loses {{as|{{pplevel|key=%|({{ccd|Gnar|as_lvl}}-{{ccd|Mega Gnar|as_lvl}})*(x-1)*(0.7025+0.0175*(x-1))|formula={{#expr:{{ccd|Gnar|as_lvl}}-{{ccd|Mega Gnar|as_lvl}}}} growth}}|attack speed}} {{as|'''bonus''' attack speed}}. '''Gnar's''' '''base''' stats '''including''' these bonuses are provided at the top of [[Gnar/LoL|Gnar's]] gameplay article, and will appear separately as '''Mega Gnar''' on list articles.''
|description2 = '''Gnar''' restores health equal to the amount gained when transforming into '''Mega Gnar''', but will only retain his {{as|'''current''' percentage health}} when returning to '''Mini''' form. This is unaffected by healing modifiers.
